msgid "Clang BackEnds"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:239
msgid "ClangAttrClasses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:241
msgid ""
"**Purpose**: Creates Attrs.inc, which contains semantic attribute class "
"declarations for any attribute in `Attr.td` that has not set `ASTNode = 0`. "
"This file is included as part of `Attr.h`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:245
msgid "ClangAttrParserStringSwitches"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:247
msgid ""
"**Purpose**: Creates `AttrParserStringSwitches.inc`, which contains "
"`StringSwitch::Case` statements for parser-related string switches. Each "
"switch is given its own macro (such as `CLANG_ATTR_ARG_CONTEXT_LIST`, or "
"`CLANG_ATTR_IDENTIFIER_ARG_LIST`), which is expected to be defined before "
"including `AttrParserStringSwitches.inc`, and undefined after."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:253
msgid "ClangAttrImpl"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:255
msgid ""
"**Purpose**: Creates `AttrImpl.inc`, which contains semantic attribute class "
"definitions for any attribute in `Attr.td` that has not set `ASTNode = 0`. "
"This file is included as part of `AttrImpl.cpp`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:259
msgid "ClangAttrList"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:261
msgid ""
"**Purpose**: Creates `AttrList.inc`, which is used when a list of semantic "
"attribute identifiers is required. For instance, `AttrKinds.h` includes this "
"file to generate the list of `attr::Kind` enumeration values. This list is "
"separated out into multiple categories: attributes, inheritable attributes, "
"and inheritable parameter attributes. This categorization happens "
"automatically based on information in `Attr.td` and is used to implement the "
"`classof` functionality required for `dyn_cast` and similar APIs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:269
msgid "ClangAttrPCHRead"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:271
