"**Purpose**: Creates `AttrSpellings.inc`, which is used to implement the "
"`__has_attribute` feature test macro."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:284
msgid "ClangAttrSpellingListIndex"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../TableGen/BackEnds.md:286
